{"5111890":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Weeping Souls","steam_appid":5111890,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Experience:<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Weeping Souls&quot; is a Chinese-style horror text adventure game. Set against the stage of the &quot;Spirit Realm,&quot; the game casts the player as the chosen college student Shen Qingci, who must move through the interweaving of the Spirit Realm and reality, experiencing one eerie event after another built from obsession and resentment. With 180,000 words of non-repeating text, different endings and different choices will lead to entirely different truths and paths of return. While carrying on the traditions of horror, suspense, and tightly woven storytelling, the game devotes even greater effort to portraying the human hearts and emotions that struggle in the darkness.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/443740ce69a7fd42f54d5992ed151896.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/443740ce69a7fd42f54d5992ed151896.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Effects:<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In terms of visual effects, we strive to create striking atmospheric contrasts. The reality sections adopt a clean and bright Korean-style anime flat-color rendering, while the Spirit Realm sections shift into a cyberpunk Chinese-horror realistic thick painting style, using dark green tones, mist, talismans, and cold light to build an oppressive and eerie otherworld. We pay close attention to the detailed depiction of both the modern city and the Spirit Realm scenes, seeking to strike a balance between horror and beauty.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/e87e7e770601cb213770c02cd2b3b3ed.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/e87e7e770601cb213770c02cd2b3b3ed.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shen Qingci<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/b2c7bc1bdaace0ada8cf3298011a024b.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/b2c7bc1bdaace0ada8cf3298011a024b.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shen Qingci is the character played by the player. He is a junior-year college student. On the surface he is an ordinary young man, but he is also a one-in-a-million &quot;Night God.&quot; To stay alive, and for the sake of the trapped spirits, he chooses to become a Spirit Realm Walker.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old Lin<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/8536768cc7a33abd2d001cee6045d4a8.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/8536768cc7a33abd2d001cee6045d4a8.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old Lin, Shen Qingci's college roommate and his best friend.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lu Xiaoyu<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/eb6d54667c3ca740a4a3903dfc39a96d.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/eb6d54667c3ca740a4a3903dfc39a96d.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lu Xiaoyu, a kind-hearted high school girl, yet trapped in the Spirit Realm and turned into a weeping soul.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grandfather<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/c2da323bd0f2e410ff9aefd88afbfb22.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/c2da323bd0f2e410ff9aefd88afbfb22.webp?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shen Qingci's grandfather, who has passed away. He left a diary for Shen Qingci.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lin Yue<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/26b76b6f886bbbecbedc9013ee4b81c9.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/26b76b6f886bbbecbedc9013ee4b81c9.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Leader Lin, the enforcement captain of the Control Unit and a loyal henchman of Uncle Li. There are many others who serve Uncle Li just as faithfully.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/4db7fb341d6476bda90d63b8eb8ab596.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/4db7fb341d6476bda90d63b8eb8ab596.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/1db228b1237c495695d79c829b32d00c.avif?t=1793761374\" width=1200 height=1200 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Effects<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In terms of audio, we pursue a sound expression that resonates highly with the game's character. All of the female characters in the game are voiced by a professional live-actor team, striving to match the emotions and fates of each character. The key male characters are likewise performed by live actors. Moreover, every Spirit Realm is equipped with its own exclusive, brand-new background music, never repeated, all to let players truly sink into the experience. Both the score and the sound effects are independently designed for each Spirit Realm scene, controlling every detail from the warmth of everyday life to the oppression of the Spirit Realm.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adult Content Description<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains some adult content elements, as follows: horror and psychological horror scenes, violent acts, depictions of blood and gore, corpses and skeletons, death and suicide themes, criminal behavior, bullying and persecution, and derogatory language. The game contains no nudity, sexual violence, or depictions of sexual acts, nor any alcohol-related content. All such representations are conveyed primarily through text narration, static imagery, and atmosphere-building, and do not include realistic bloodshed or depictions of harm.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Experience:<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Weeping Souls&quot; is a Chinese-style horror text adventure game. Set against the stage of the &quot;Spirit Realm,&quot; the game casts the player as the chosen college student Shen Qingci, who must move through the interweaving of the Spirit Realm and reality, experiencing one eerie event after another built from obsession and resentment. With 180,000 words of non-repeating text, different endings and different choices will lead to entirely different truths and paths of return. While carrying on the traditions of horror, suspense, and tightly woven storytelling, the game devotes even greater effort to portraying the human hearts and emotions that struggle in the darkness.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/443740ce69a7fd42f54d5992ed151896.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/443740ce69a7fd42f54d5992ed151896.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Effects:<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In terms of visual effects, we strive to create striking atmospheric contrasts. The reality sections adopt a clean and bright Korean-style anime flat-color rendering, while the Spirit Realm sections shift into a cyberpunk Chinese-horror realistic thick painting style, using dark green tones, mist, talismans, and cold light to build an oppressive and eerie otherworld. We pay close attention to the detailed depiction of both the modern city and the Spirit Realm scenes, seeking to strike a balance between horror and beauty.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/e87e7e770601cb213770c02cd2b3b3ed.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/e87e7e770601cb213770c02cd2b3b3ed.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shen Qingci<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/b2c7bc1bdaace0ada8cf3298011a024b.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/b2c7bc1bdaace0ada8cf3298011a024b.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shen Qingci is the character played by the player. He is a junior-year college student. On the surface he is an ordinary young man, but he is also a one-in-a-million &quot;Night God.&quot; To stay alive, and for the sake of the trapped spirits, he chooses to become a Spirit Realm Walker.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old Lin<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/8536768cc7a33abd2d001cee6045d4a8.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/8536768cc7a33abd2d001cee6045d4a8.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old Lin, Shen Qingci's college roommate and his best friend.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lu Xiaoyu<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/eb6d54667c3ca740a4a3903dfc39a96d.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/eb6d54667c3ca740a4a3903dfc39a96d.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lu Xiaoyu, a kind-hearted high school girl, yet trapped in the Spirit Realm and turned into a weeping soul.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grandfather<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/c2da323bd0f2e410ff9aefd88afbfb22.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/c2da323bd0f2e410ff9aefd88afbfb22.webp?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shen Qingci's grandfather, who has passed away. He left a diary for Shen Qingci.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lin Yue<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/26b76b6f886bbbecbedc9013ee4b81c9.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/26b76b6f886bbbecbedc9013ee4b81c9.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Leader Lin, the enforcement captain of the Control Unit and a loyal henchman of Uncle Li. There are many others who serve Uncle Li just as faithfully.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/4db7fb341d6476bda90d63b8eb8ab596.avif?t=1793761374\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras_big\/4db7fb341d6476bda90d63b8eb8ab596.avif?t=1793761374 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5111890\/extras\/1db228b1237c495695d79c829b32d00c.avif?t=1793761374\" width=1200 height=1200 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Effects<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In terms of audio, we pursue a sound expression that resonates highly with the game's character. All of the female characters in the game are voiced by a professional live-actor team, striving to match the emotions and fates of each character. The key male characters are likewise performed by live actors. Moreover, every Spirit Realm is equipped with its own exclusive, brand-new background music, never repeated, all to let players truly sink into the experience. Both the score and the sound effects are independently designed for each Spirit Realm scene, controlling every detail from the warmth of everyday life to the oppression of the Spirit Realm.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adult Content Description<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains some adult content elements, as follows: horror and psychological horror scenes, violent acts, depictions of blood and gore, corpses and skeletons, death and suicide themes, criminal behavior, bullying and persecution, and derogatory language. The game contains no nudity, sexual violence, or depictions of sexual acts, nor any alcohol-related content. All such representations are conveyed primarily through text narration, static imagery, and atmosphere-building, and do not include realistic bloodshed or depictions of harm.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p>","short_description":"&quot;Weeping Souls&quot; is a visual novel game. The player takes on the role of the protagonist and chooses the right path to ensure the safety of themselves and their friends. The game features multiple endings, determined by your 